  "body": "## Breaking Changes \r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n* fix: respect named-vector source_properties when re-vectorizing on update by @g-despot in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/11789\r\n* Silence expected recovered-panic noise in async replication scheduler unit tests by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12808\r\n* fix(hfresh): decode centroid codes with the right quantizer in split/merge reassignment by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12795\r\n* chore(gen-code-from-swagger.sh): add code formatting step by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12814\r\n* mcp: refuse GET with 405 and run the streamable server stateless by @g-despot in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12789\r\n* fix(kmeans): compute FitBalanced centers from the balanced membership by @abdelr in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12804\r\n* feat(rest): structured reference selection (returnReferences) by @g-despot in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12424\r\n* Back up collections concurrently through one shared worker pool by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12790\r\n* Stop holding the collection map lock while counting objects on disk by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12825\r\n* feat(hfresh): debug endpoint to reassign all vectors in place by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12820\r\n* Fix count aggregation over shards, and resolve its routing plan once by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12791\r\n* RQ4 centered quantization by @trengrj in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12502\r\n* Skip vanished files and directories instead of failing shard usage by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12832\r\n* Fix shard loaded and unloaded metrics by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12827\r\n* Cache object count for lazy shards by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12835\r\n* Add weaviate_shards, a shard count by state and eager or lazy loading by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12831\r\n* Finish the startup shard warmup after a shard fails to load by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12837\r\n* feat(generative-meta): add Meta AI generative module by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12839\r\n* test(generative-aws): remove Cohere's Command-R models from tests by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12841\r\n* Disable background lazy tenant loading for small tenants by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12834\r\n* fix(lsmkv): give test SegmentGroups a logger to stop slow-read nil panic by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12843\r\n* Run every row of the object authorization tables by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12840\r\n* security(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto dependency to 0.55.0 by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12851\r\n* perf(inverted): cut batched Contains extraction allocations and faster segment-index reads by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12436\r\n* lsmkv, inverted: read a batch of roaring set rows through one batch reader by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12530\r\n* Shut down test indexes so background flush cannot race TempDir cleanup by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12858\r\n* inverted: hold the batched Contains keys as a sorted slab by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12614\r\n* lsmkv: read the batched Contains keys from a memtable a window at a time by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12701\r\n* fix(kmeans): replace FitBalanced's post-hoc balancing with in-loop size-constrained assignment by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12854\r\n* feat(hfresh): cluster posting splits on full-precision vectors by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12863\r\n* Refuse property names that collide with migration directories by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12873\r\n* perf(hfresh): fetch split vectors through a single bucket view by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12875\r\n* fix(reindex): only checkpoint reindex progress once the data is durable by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12877\r\n* security: bump google gRPC dependencies by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12897\r\n* test(cluster): fix snapshot-restore flake racing the cluster-ID commit by @moogacs in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12902\r\n* ci: remove multinode-restart-a reindex pipeline by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12895\r\n* fix(db): fail queries on a deregistered bucket instead of dereferencing nil by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12870\r\n* fix(hfresh): resolve buckets per operation instead of caching them by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12887\r\n* Commit replicated puts on object copies to unrace the broadcast marshal by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12828\r\n* ci(drop-vector-index): always run drop vector index e2e tests by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12910\r\n* fix(reindex): RAFT-numbered directories stop a restart reporting success on an unbuilt index by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12888\r\n* test(python): pin weaviate-client python dependency to 4.23 version by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12908\r\n* perf(asyncrep): prune the scheduler due-count scan via the heap invariant by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12929\r\n* fix: nearObject beacon consistency by @trengrj in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12930\r\n* reindex: durable migration record (part 1/2, inert) by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12847\r\n* perf(lsmkv): read and seek segment indexes without materializing keys by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12856\r\n* perf(asyncrep): reuse per-worker request assembly in root-prefilter clients by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12939\r\n* fix(aggregation-pr1): return scan errors rather than partial results or panics by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12883\r\n* hnsw: lock each neighbor before reading its connections in ACORN search by @jfrancoa in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12936\r\n* perf(aggregation-pr2): reuse one object buffer per scan worker by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12899\r\n* perf(aggregation-pr3): scan all objects through one reader per segment by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12911\r\n* perf(aggregation-pr4): take one consistent view for the whole scan by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12913\r\n* perf(aggregation-pr5): read a segment node straight into the caller's buffer by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12914\r\n* perf(aggregation-pr6): let scan workers claim doc IDs one at a time by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12940\r\n* perf(aggregation-pr7): reuse one property map for all objects a scan worker reads by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12941\r\n* perf(inverted): call ctx.Err() directly instead of the ctxExpired helper by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12943\r\n* security(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto to v0.56.0 by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12963\r\n* security: restrict Google module apiEndpoint, region and location to Google API hosts by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12961\r\n* backport: stop reading memberlist node fields outside the event callbacks by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12947\r\n* perf: cache node host:port resolution behind membership events by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12946\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/compare/v1.39.2...v1.39.3",
